{"id":"rfe2cjcfj7g0dyqkyr93ikslh","title":"思想之书·1·3、逻辑与客观","originalTitle":null,"summary":"逻辑与客观的关系在于逻辑是被言说的客观，一旦被意识和言说，客观就脱离了存在之流，成为逻辑。实在论认为逻辑源自于客观，但逻辑并非可言说的客观，而是未被分割的客观在逻辑中的显现。运动变化和逻辑是同一形式，逻辑是对客观的部分理解，具有绝对性，但不是客观本身。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1767125&do=blog&id=1561536"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T03:00:35.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T07:37:13.071Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T07:37:13.071Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":14,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2a3544c2-4a61-410a-a88f-efb7ab106791","title":"逻辑与客观关系的理论分歧"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2a3544c2-4a61-410a-a88f-efb7ab106791","title":"逻辑与客观关系的理论分歧"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fsqaVMXHESnA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}